{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paranormal Survey is a &quot;Spot The Difference&quot; style game, look out for moving objects, objects growing in size, paintings may change, and certain other spooky events may occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been hired to oversee the reporting and removal of a paranormal presence in the Parker Mansion, the Old Cathedral, and the mysterious Facility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your job is to find all of the anomalies and simply click them to report them, be careful though, if you reach 10 active anomalies its game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 levels to observe and explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Difficulty settings (Easy, Medium, Hard)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Hallowed Grounds!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3606520/9572d54786afb3aeb9529324010d25dace4c40f1.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606520?t=1744135956","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606520?t=1744135956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606520/3ab820e1f63262e7c481c566e207d1a59c39dac6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744135956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606520/3ab820e1f63262e7c481c566e207d1a59c39dac6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744135956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_d